<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_5/tu_0046> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/su_verified_6ed52cdf724db04223b4d1c2e62f3c35f6b42bc19bc5e3198277d681d47e1eb9_table_5/e_0089> .
